					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120826,
					"content": "好啦，我们可以结案了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120827,
					"content": "你看，很显然是马队被人伏击，物资也都被抢走了。我们可以回去向尤夫腾回报情况啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120828,
					"content": "嗯，我们回去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120829
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120829,
					"content": "不好意思，两位客人请留步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "镀金旅团刺客"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120830,
					"content": "欸…你们是谁呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120831,
					"content": "我们是婕德的朋友，辛苦你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "镀金旅团刺客"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120832,
					"content": "这样呀，婕德的朋友就是我们的朋友！正好我们这边也忙完啦，我们一起回去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120833
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120833,
					"content": "哈哈，不着急，客人不用着急回去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "镀金旅团刺客"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120834,
					"content": "等等，派蒙…他们有些不对劲。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120835
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120835,
					"content": "婕德说，希望你们在沙漠里多留一段时间…她委托我们在这里「招待」一下你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120836
					],
					"speakerTitle": "镀金旅团刺客"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120836,
					"content": "希望你不要辜负她的好意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "镀金旅团刺客"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120837,
					"content": "#欸…？{NICKNAME}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120838,
					"content": "躲起来，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120839
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120839,
					"content": "好、好的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120823,
					"content": "有道理呢，但我们还没有足够证据。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120824
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120820,
					"content": "是派蒙的直觉时间！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120821
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120814,
					"content": "丢弃那些，是出于轻装赶路的需要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120815
					]
				}
