					"nextDialogs": [
						732121004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121004,
					"content": "对、对了，关、关、关、关于商队的事情…你们调查得如何了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121005,
					"content": "商队遭到了伏击，货物被洗劫了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121006
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732121006,
					"content": "可恶！可恶！又是那群叛徒搞的鬼！一、一定、一定是的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121007,
					"content": "叛徒…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121008,
					"content": "叛、叛、叛徒，和北方人勾结的狗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121009,
					"content": "除了、除了这个，你、你、你们还发现了什么吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121010,
					"content": "我们遭到了镀金旅团的袭击。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121011
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732121011,
					"content": "嗯，我们刚调查完商队，就被突然出现的镀金旅团坏家伙袭击了！他们还说是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121012,
					"content": "他们还说他们认识我们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121013
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732121013,
					"content": "呃…对！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121014
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121014,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121015,
					"content": "果、果、果然如此…他们也盯上了您。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121016
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121016,
					"content": "这里是您的报、报、报酬。请、请快点去和芭别尔主母说说这件事吧，事、事、事不宜迟！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121017,
					"content": "好、好的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121018
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732121018,
					"content": "再、再见。尊贵的「镇灵主人」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "尤夫腾"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7321211,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7321211
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7321211",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7321211,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"芭别尔"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732121101,
					"content": "你来了，尊贵的「镇灵主人」，请问有什么急事吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121102,
					"content": "尤夫腾的商队被「叛徒」洗劫了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732121103,
					"content": "这样吗…这并不奇怪，因为从雪国而来的北方人一直在渗透我们的领地，许多叛徒听信了他们的诱惑，转而与我们为敌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121104,
					"content": "这些人一直在作乱，零星的劫掠事件时有发生，从几个月前就是如此了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121105,
					"content": "呃…抱歉，我没想故意打断你，请你继续。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121106,
					"content": "那些「叛徒」也盯上了我们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732121107,
					"content": "嗯，我们刚调查完商队，镀金旅团坏家伙就突然出现，袭击了我们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121108,
					"content": "这样吗…可恶啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121109,
					"content": "看起来…即使失去了阿德菲和阿萨里格，这群野狗依然敢对我们吐露獠牙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121110,
					"content": "这样吧，请你们先留在这里休息压惊，你们的安全保护工作我会亲自负责。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121111,
					"content": "婕德还在外面执行部落的任务，待她回来，我会委托她同你一起调查此事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121112,
					"content": "而在这之前，我会负责全力追查袭击你们的凶手…请你们宽心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121113,
					"content": "唔…还有还有！拦截我们的那群坏东西似乎认识我们！他们可能是部落里的人呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121114,
					"content": "不是没有可能…但没关系，你们受宾客权利保护…只要还在这里，就没有人会伤害你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121115,
					"content": "如果有人试图在塔尼特部落内为难你们，无论那人是谁，我都会以主母的身份追究到底。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121116,
					"content": "请你休息一下吧，关于叛徒的事件，我会全力追查的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121117,
					"content": "另外，我也会替你留意婕德的，等她回来就第一时间通知你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121118,
					"content": "嗯嗯，那就谢谢你啦，芭别尔主母！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732121119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732121119,
					"content": "请不必客气。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				}
			]
		},
